  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The context",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "Industrial designers at Decathlon were discovering AI tools on their own, in a scattered way. Leadership wanted to “give them a tool”, without knowing how designers really worked or what was blocking them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The question",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Map how designers actually use AI today, by seniority and craft",
            "Identify the real barriers to adoption",
            "Recommend what the company should invest in"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "custom",
          "html": "<figure style=\"margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #F7F8FC; border: 1px solid #E3E3EA\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4A4A57; text-align: center\">Seniority →</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 auto\"><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px\"><div style=\"background: #EEF1FA; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; min-height: 80px\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">Experienced explorers</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #4A4A57\">Already using several tools</span></div><div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; min-height: 80px\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">Senior and cautious</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #4A4A57\">Need proof and rules</span></div><div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; min-height: 80px\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">Self-taught explorers</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #4A4A57\">Curious, experimenting alone</span></div><div style=\"background: #FBEAE8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; min-height: 80px\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">Curious but blocked</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #4A4A57\">Want to, don’t know where to start</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4A4A57\">Comfort with AI tools →</div></div></div>\n<figcaption style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4A57\">Segmentation of designer profiles (illustrative)</figcaption>\n</figure>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I did",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Community-wide survey with heatmaps by seniority",
            "Segmentation into profiles to recruit the right people",
            "Designer interviews and field days in Sallanches",
            "Risk sessions with Legal, IT and the data team, plus a vendor benchmark"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What we learned",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "note",
          "text": "To complete: key findings, and what surprised us."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What changed",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "The top barrier was not the tech but “not knowing which tool to use”",
            "The project shifted from buying a tool to an adoption programme: licences, training, a sandbox",
            "Insights presented to 300–400 designers at Designer Day"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "custom",
          "html": "<figure style=\"margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: #F7F8FC; border: 1px solid #E3E3EA\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px\"><div style=\"flex: 1 1 240px; min-width: 0\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #A42A1C; margin-bottom: 8px\">Before</span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px\"><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #FBEAE8; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\">“We just need a tool”</span><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #FBEAE8; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\">Scattered experiments</span><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #FBEAE8; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\">No shared rules</span></div></div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 240px; min-width: 0\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2A3F8F; margin-bottom: 8px\">After</span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px\"><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #EEF1FA; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\">Licences</span><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #EEF1FA; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\">Training</span><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #EEF1FA; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\">Sandbox for new tech</span><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #EEF1FA; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600\">Curious profiles train others</span></div></div></div>\n<figcaption style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4A57\">From a tool to a programme</figcaption>\n</figure>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I liked",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "quote",
          "text": "Watching the question change in the room: from “which tool?” to “how do we learn together?”. That is research doing its job."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I’d change",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "I would have involved Legal and IT from week one instead of mid-way, to shorten the path from insight to licences."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What remains unknown",
      "long_title": true,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "note",
          "text": "To complete: open questions, limits, what deserves another look."
        }
      ]
    }
